---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
---
<Layout>
<Fragment slot="head">
<meta name="description" content="ChatGPT, Gemini, and Claude compared through real projects: rebuilding WordPress sites and dormant domains with AI, what worked in minutes, what took days, and the prompts that survived.">
<title>Building Websites With AI: What Hours of Real Use Taught Me | BlueYucca Blog</title>
<link rel="canonical" href="https://blueyucca.com/blog/building-websites-with-ai">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="BlueYucca">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="Building Websites With AI: What Hours of Real Use Taught Me | BlueYucca Blog">
<meta property="og:description" content="ChatGPT, Gemini, and Claude compared through real projects: rebuilding WordPress sites and dormant domains with AI, what worked in minutes, what took days, and the prompts that survived.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://blueyucca.com/blog/building-websites-with-ai">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
<style is:inline>
  :root {
    --cream: #FAF6ED; --cream-deep: #F3ECDC; --card: #FFFDF8;
    --sand: #E5DAC3; --sand-dark: #D5C6A5;
    --ink: #1E2A45; --ink-soft: #52607E;
    --blue: #2455C4; --blue-deep: #17357F; --blue-dark: #1B3A8C;
    --blue-soft: #4B79DC; --blue-wash: #E9EFFB; --blue-line: #C9D8F5;
    --haz: #F2C94C;
    --mono: "SFMono-Regular", Menlo, Consolas, "Courier New", monospace;
  }
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background: var(--cream); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  ::selection { background: var(--blue); color: var(--cream); }
  a { color: var(--blue); }
  .wrap { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
  .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease; }
  .reveal.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; }
    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
  }

  .hero { padding: 64px 0 40px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.1rem); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 850; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .lede { font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 2vw, 1.15rem); color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 26px; }
  section { padding: 8px 0 56px; }
  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block; font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blue);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--blue-line); background: var(--blue-wash);
    border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px 10px; margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); margin: 42px 0 12px; }
  h3 { color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;
    padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 1rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--blue-deep); margin: 4px 8px 4px 0;
    transition: transform 0.1s ease, box-shadow 0.1s ease; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--blue-deep); }
  .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(3px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--blue-deep); }
  .btn-ghost { color: var(--blue-deep); background: var(--card); box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--sand-dark); border-color: var(--ink); }
  .btn-ghost:hover { transform: translateY(3px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--sand-dark); }
  .note {
    background: var(--blue-wash); border: 2px solid var(--blue-line); border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 18px 22px; font-size: 0.98rem; margin: 28px 0;
  }
  .pricetag {
    display: inline-block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--blue-deep); background: var(--haz);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px 10px;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--sand-dark); transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
  }
  ul.check { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 16px 0; }
  ul.check li { padding: 7px 0 7px 32px; position: relative; color: var(--ink); }
  ul.check li::before {
    content: "\2713"; position: absolute; left: 4px; top: 7px;
    color: var(--blue); font-weight: 900; font-family: var(--mono);
  }
  .promptbox {
    background: #141821; color: #C7E3D4; border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 20px 22px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6;
    white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 16px 0; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--sand-dark);
  }
  .retro-badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--blue-deep); background: var(--card);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 5px 12px; margin-bottom: 18px; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--sand-dark);
  }
  footer.site-footer { border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); margin-top: 48px; padding: 40px 0 48px; text-align: center; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.93rem; }
  footer.site-footer nav { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  footer.site-footer nav a { color: var(--blue-deep); text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px; font-weight: 600; }
  footer.site-footer nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {  .hero { padding: 44px 0 28px; } }
  article { max-width: 720px; }
  article p { margin-bottom: 18px; color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.04rem; }
  article h2 { margin-top: 36px; }
  .datechip {
    display: inline-block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--blue-deep); background: var(--cream-deep);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--sand-dark); border-radius: 6px; padding: 2px 9px; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .backlink { font-weight: 700; }
  .signoff { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); border-top: 2px dashed var(--sand-dark); padding-top: 18px; margin-top: 32px; }
</style>
</Fragment>
<Header />

<div class="wrap">
  <section class="hero" style="padding-bottom: 6px;">
    <span class="eyebrow">Notes from the lab</span>
    <span style="display:block"></span>
    <h1>I put hours and hours into building websites with AI so you do not have to.</h1>
    <span class="datechip">2026-07-24</span>
  </section>

  <article>
    <p>Everything on this site, the templates, the prompt builder, the coaching notes, came out of one long stretch of me actually doing the thing: building real websites with AI tools, over and over, for real projects. Hours and hours and hours of it. This post is the honest version of how that went.</p>

    <h2>The tour of tools</h2>

    <p>I started with ChatGPT, spent a long stretch leaning on Gemini, and these days Claude is my go to. But I still cross-check between all three, and I recommend you do the same. Here is a thing that took me too long to learn: they do not mind. You can tell Claude that ChatGPT wrote something and ask what it would change, and it does not get its feelings hurt. It will even make the handoff easy for you. Treating them like three contractors bidding on the same job is not rude. It is just good practice.</p>

    <h2>What I actually rebuilt</h2>

    <p>The sites I rebuilt were not practice projects. Some were living on WordPress. Some were dormant domains that had been sitting far too long. And the most embarrassing one was my own: Cultivatum LLC, the company I run everything through, had a website neglected for more years than I want to type, because the brands always got the attention and the front door never did. If you have ever let your own site rot while you took care of everything else, I understand you completely.</p>

    <p>Here is the honest score. Some sites came out in minutes and I genuinely loved them, and the only remaining work was refining details. Others took a lot of back and forth, and sometimes jumping between the different tools to figure out what one of them could not. Same person, same skills, different day, different result. That variability is real, it is normal, and it is exactly why every template page here carries a coaching note saying so. It is not a sign you did something wrong. It is just how these helpers are.</p>

    <h2>The part where you take my homework</h2>

    <p>All of that trial and error got distilled into what is on this site. The <a href="/examples">templates</a> are patterns that survived contact with reality. The <a href="/prompt-builder">prompt builder</a> writes the kind of prompt I ended up writing by hand a hundred times. Take them. Remix them. Feed them to whichever AI you like.</p>

    <p>And then, this is the part I actually care about, <a href="/contact">share what you build with me</a>. Send your site, your thoughts, your improved prompts, your disagreements. Cultivatum started years ago from a simple passion: help small businesses grow and focus on what they do best. BlueYucca is that same passion with the price removed. Seeing your site go live is the whole payoff.</p>

    <p class="signoff">Total spent on the tools that built this site: more hours than dollars. The dollars were $0.00.</p>
    <p><a class="backlink" href="/blog/">&#8592; Back to the blog</a></p>
  </article>
</div>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="retro-badge">MORE HOURS THAN DOLLARS</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="/">Home</a> &middot;
      <a href="/business-in-a-box">Business in a Box</a> &middot;
      <a href="/examples">Examples</a> &middot;
      <a href="/prompt-builder">Prompt Builder</a> &middot;
      <a href="/hosting">Hosting Guide</a> &middot;
      <a href="/blog/">Blog</a> &middot;
      <a href="/contact">Contact</a> &middot;
      <a href="/frontpage/">The FrontPage Experiment</a> &middot;
      <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@blueyucca">TikTok</a>
    </nav>
    <div>BlueYucca is a <a href="https://cultivatum.com">Cultivatum LLC</a> project, part of the <a href="https://kakt.ai">kakt.ai</a> family. Arizona, est. 2003.</div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script is:inline>
(function () {
  var els = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
  if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) { els.forEach(function (el) { el.classList.add('in'); }); return; }
  var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
    entries.forEach(function (e) { if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(e.target); } });
  }, { threshold: 0.12 });
  els.forEach(function (el) { io.observe(el); });
})();
</script>
</Layout>
